ss=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Charge forward and attack the first enemy in your way, possibly pushing them <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Off_Balance_(Condition)\" title=\"Off Balance (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Off Balance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Off_Balance_(Condition)\" title=\"Off Balance (Condition)\">Off Balance</a>. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl></div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Knights_of_the_Shield_Hideout\" title=\"Knights of the Shield Hideout\">Knights of the Shield Hideout</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-728&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;588</span>: In the hidden room during the quest <a href=\"/wiki/Visit_the_Emperor%27s_Old_Hideout\" title=\"Visit the Emperor's Old Hideout\">Visit the Emperor's Old Hideout</a></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n\n<p><i>Regarding Shapeshifter Slayer:</i></p>\n<ul><li>Shapeshifter Slayer adds 1d4 to attack rolls in addition to the damage roll listed.\n<ul><li>This passive also applies to ranged attacks while this weapon is equipped, adding 1d4 to attack and damage for them.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Any spell cast while this weapon is equipped gains 1d4 to its attack roll but its damage is not increased.</li></ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195014\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.122 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.136 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4470/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 64495/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 13936/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.046/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1656940/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  109.646      1 Template:WeaponPage\n100.00%  109.646      1 -total\n 26.03%   28.539     47 Template:Trim\n 21.30%   23.356     14 Template:Icon_text\n 13.51%   14.813      3 Template:Spell_action/format\n 10.66%   11.683      3 Template:Uid\n 10.46%   11.472      2 Template:Dam